  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (0.653). This experiment tests adding image data (resnet50) to this strong baseline, using transformer aggregation and concat fusion to isolate the impact of multimodal integration. It balances exploitation of proven RNA encoder strengths with exploration of multimodal potential, addressing a key design choice (image modality) without changing multiple factors simultaneously."
